    <li><a href="https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/fact-sheets/17g-overtime-salary" rel="noopener">US Department of Labor — Fact Sheet #17G: Salary Basis Requirement</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/fact-sheets/17i-overtime-blue-collar" rel="noopener">US Department of Labor — Fact Sheet #17I: Blue-Collar Workers and First Responders</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/overtime" rel="noopener">US Department of Labor — Overtime Pay (current salary threshold)</a></li>
  </ul>
